  "zulu": {"p":"'zu:lu:","en":"She has been learning Zulu so she can talk with people in South Africa.","zh":"她一直在学祖鲁语，以便能和南非人交谈。","u":"既指祖鲁人，也指祖鲁语，首字母常大写。"},
  "zum": {"en":"In German, \"zum\" often appears in phrases like \"zum Beispiel\", meaning \"for example\".","zh":"在德语中，zum 常出现在像 zum Beispiel 这样的短语里，意思是“例如”。","u":"德语介词，常与 dem 缩合，后接名词。"},
